Psynguechthyngue

Psynguechthyngue is an independent, unofficial client. It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the Syncthing project. The name
"Syncthing" is used only to identify the software and intended protocol
compatibility. This project does not use the Syncthing logo.

The app embeds unmodified upstream Syncthing v2.1.6 (tag v2.1.6, commit
4461a1ce354d3990660966ad70176e00246adb61), licensed under the Mozilla Public
License 2.0. No patches are applied to Syncthing; it is consumed as the
upstream Go module and linked through a thin bridge package of this project.

Syncthing source (the exact version used):
https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing/tree/4461a1ce354d3990660966ad70176e00246adb61

Syncthing license (Mozilla Public License 2.0):
https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing/blob/4461a1ce354d3990660966ad70176e00246adb61/LICENSE

The Syncthing source code, together with this project's source code, can
also be obtained from this project's repository:
https://github.com/simon300000/Psynguechthyngue

The production dependency graph also contains other MPL-2.0 modules (for
example github.com/hashicorp/golang-lru/v2). The complete list of linked
third-party Go modules, their versions, detected licenses and license texts
is recorded in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and Docs/SBOM.spdx.json.

The Psynguechthyngue AppIcon and project visual assets are original project
artwork, not Syncthing artwork.

